{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52017","headline":"山园 · 王绩","name":"山园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽人养性灵，长啸坐山扃。\n二月兰心紫，三春柳色青。\n卷帘看水石，开牖望园亭。\n琴曲唯留古，书名半是经。\n风烟长入咏，几杖悉爲铭。\n切直平生尽，何爲劳是形？\n（按：《文献通考·经籍考》引《周氏涉笔》录「琴曲唯留古，书多半是经」二句，《全唐诗》卷三七收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}